-- Drops the laplace.* copies of index_usage_report / index_usage_detail; the
-- ops.* functions are the live ones. Removing a file from the manifests does
-- not retract a CREATE an installed database already ran, so the drop is its
-- own module. IF EXISTS throughout; qualified laplace.* so it cannot touch ops.*.
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.index_usage_report(bigint);
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.index_usage_detail(text, integer);
